contentText:
Kylie Minogue has also seen those rumors that she might be a secret guest star on Madonna &#8216;s upcoming Confessions II album. The whispers ramped up on Tuesday (May 19) when a Los Angeles Times interviewer asked Minogue about an Instagram post hinting at a new music video shoot, which led to some fan wish-making about a superstar diva team-up on Madonna&#8217;s upcoming (July 3) sequel to her 2005 Billboard 200 No. 1 album, Confessions on a Dance Floor .

